<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  body { font-family: Calibri, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; color:#222; margin: 18px; }
  h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 20px 0 6px; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #b8c4d6; padding: 5px 10px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
  th { background: #2f5597; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  td.m { text-align: left; }
  td.rid { font-family: Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #666; text-align: left;
           padding-top: 0; border-top: 0; }
  tr.delta td { background: #fff4e6; font-weight: 700; }
  tr.best td { background: #eef5ff; }
  .hl { color: #b05a00; font-weight: 700; }
  .note { font-size: 14.5px; color: #555; line-height: 1.55; }
</style>

<h2>主模型 = N4 Motion-Aligned RSSM（三个 seed，同一份 config）</h2>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>seed</th><th>BEST Overall 3D</th><th>@ep</th>
    <th>BEST Overall BEV</th><th>窗口 3D (ep12-16)</th><th>窗口 BEV</th>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class="m">seed0</td><td>39.88</td><td>ep16</td><td>47.70</td><td>38.39</td><td>46.52</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="m">seed1</td><td>40.51</td><td>ep15</td><td>48.13</td><td>39.20</td><td>46.85</td></tr>
  <tr class="best"><td class="m"><b>seed2（最高）</b></td><td class="hl">40.88</td><td class="hl">ep14</td>
      <td class="hl">49.85</td><td class="hl">39.40</td><td class="hl">48.33</td></tr>
  <tr class="delta"><td class="m">均值</td><td>40.42 ± 0.51</td><td>ep14–16</td><td>48.56</td><td>39.00</td><td>47.23</td></tr>
</table>
<p class="note">
三个 seed 共用同一份 config（seed0/seed2 仅差 <code>checkpoint_config interval</code>，属记账项）。
</p>

